<title>THAILAND: Sanyo Universal annual net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Sanyo Universal annual net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reviewed financial audited results for Sanyo Universal for the year ended 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					  For 12 months</p>
<p>				     1996	    1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		   4.66	    16.46</p>
<p>    Net			    204.96	  462.1</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is Sanyo Universal Plc. It is a manufacturer of electrical appliances.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
